      "id": "tesamorelin-ipamorelin",
      "name": "Tesamorelin + Ipamorelin Stack",
      "aliases": [],
      "kind": "other",
      "identityStatus": "needs_confirmation",
      "categoryID": 4,
      "benefits": "Proposed rationale: use two GH-axis agents together, drawing on tesamorelin's single-drug visceral-fat evidence and ipamorelin's short-term hormone-release research. No direct efficacy study of this separate-product stack was located. Benefits of one ingredient do not establish a benefit of taking both together, an additive effect, or superiority to either alone. Claims of better fat loss, muscle gain, recovery, sleep, or longevity remain unverified for this combination."
    }
